{"4510790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kartboard Dash", "steam_appid": 4510790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510790/extras/cbdc68306be3e1adb278d36ef3a6e3dc.avif?t=1787120607\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kartboard Dash is a fast-paced arcade kart racer where everything-tracks, karts, and the entire world-is built from cardboard, tape, and pure imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through handcrafted tracks packed with sharp turns, ramps, obstacles, and surprises. The world may look playful, but the racing is intense, chaotic, and highly competitive. Quick reactions, smart powerup usage, and adapting to constant changes are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510790/extras/d32933af42364a5318fffc04ffb3b01f.avif?t=1787120607\" width=614 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📦 Built From Cardboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a unique DIY world where every track, prop, and kart feels handcrafted.<br>From taped edges to layered textures, each environment brings a playful yet detailed racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚡ Chaotic Powerups</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up powerups during races to gain the edge—or cause chaos.<br>Boost ahead, slow rivals, or disrupt the track at just the right moment to turn the race in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔄 </strong>The race changes every lap. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final two laps, random modifiers activate for ALL players — speed surges, bumper madness, hazard trails. You can master the track. You can never master what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden speed boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumper-style collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard trails behind karts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected chaos that forces instant adaptation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two races ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎭 Unique Characters &amp; Karts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing roster of racers and karts, each bringing their own personality to the track.<br>Mix and match to find your perfect racing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Races</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dynamic powerups, evolving modifiers, and creative track design, every race feels fresh, chaotic, and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏎️ Fast, Accessible Arcade Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master.<br>Whether you're drifting through corners or battling for first place, the action never slows down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kartboard Dash is designed to deliver fast, chaotic, and endlessly replayable races.<br>You’re not just racing the track—you’re reacting to everything happening around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lap brings new surprises. Every race tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📅 Coming Soon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beta playable build releasing <strong>soon</strong>. <br>Wishlist now and be among the first to jump into the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510790/extras/cb19b5a2064b86dc182c6ab328985590.avif?t=1787120607\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510790/extras/cbdc68306be3e1adb278d36ef3a6e3dc.avif?t=1787120607\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kartboard Dash is a fast-paced arcade kart racer where everything-tracks, karts, and the entire world-is built from cardboard, tape, and pure imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through handcrafted tracks packed with sharp turns, ramps, obstacles, and surprises. The world may look playful, but the racing is intense, chaotic, and highly competitive. Quick reactions, smart powerup usage, and adapting to constant changes are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510790/extras/d32933af42364a5318fffc04ffb3b01f.avif?t=1787120607\" width=614 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📦 Built From Cardboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a unique DIY world where every track, prop, and kart feels handcrafted.<br>From taped edges to layered textures, each environment brings a playful yet detailed racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚡ Chaotic Powerups</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up powerups during races to gain the edge—or cause chaos.<br>Boost ahead, slow rivals, or disrupt the track at just the right moment to turn the race in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔄 </strong>The race changes every lap. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final two laps, random modifiers activate for ALL players — speed surges, bumper madness, hazard trails. You can master the track. You can never master what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden speed boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumper-style collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard trails behind karts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected chaos that forces instant adaptation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two races ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎭 Unique Characters &amp; Karts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing roster of racers and karts, each bringing their own personality to the track.<br>Mix and match to find your perfect racing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Races</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dynamic powerups, evolving modifiers, and creative track design, every race feels fresh, chaotic, and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏎️ Fast, Accessible Arcade Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master.<br>Whether you're drifting through corners or battling for first place, the action never slows down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kartboard Dash is designed to deliver fast, chaotic, and endlessly replayable races.<br>You’re not just racing the track—you’re reacting to everything happening around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lap brings new surprises. Every race tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📅 Coming Soon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beta playable build releasing <strong>soon</strong>. <br>Wishlist now and be among the first to jump into the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn